      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS NASHVILLE (7) is a promising filly who made it two from two when winning well last start by 2.7 metres at Port Pirie. Interesting to see what unfolds from this wide draw but she has plenty of upside. WEREGOINGTOGETCHA (2) had to dig deep to score last start at this circuit and distance, getting home by just 1.8 metres after working. That was her third success from her last three outings. Should have no excuses from this advantageous draw so has strong claims again. TWIN CONNECTION (3) has only once missed the top-three in her last six starts. Draws well and was good in a last-start win by 2 metres at this circuit and distance. MANDS PEARL (4) is in the mix after chasing WEREGOINGTOGETCHA for second at her most recent appearance.",
